* What's New in GNU Hyperbole by Bob Weiner

`======================================================================'


1 V9.3.2
════════

  `======================================================================'


1.1 BUTTONS  (See ).
────────────────────

  *** Hyperbole buttons can now be wrapped in double square bracket org
      link delimiters when in Org mode with the addition of a single
      line to your Hyperbole use-package configuration:

  (push #'hyperbole-activate-button org-open-link-functions)

  Then you get all the Hyperbole button capabilities with the
  highlighting and the activation of Org links via {C-c C-o}.  Of
  course, the Action Key will activate these buttons as well.

  Since Emacs Lisp sybmols are Hyperbole buttons, you can make links to
  both function and variable definitons just by wrapping their names in
  Org delimiters.  For example, or .


1.2 DOCUMENTATION
─────────────────

  *** : HY-NEWS has been renamed to HY-NEWS.org.

  When an Org link with an embedded button is activated with {C-c C-o}
  and Hyperbole has not yet been loaded but is installed, it will
  autoload Hyperbole to run the action for the button.

  *** : Add missing entries from the current HyWiki menu.


1.3 PROGRAMMING INTERFACE CHANGES  (See ).
──────────────────────────────────────────

  *** Add for use in .  Used in "README.md".

